cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VeriVar, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "VeriVar: citation-grounded, dual-mode LLM interpretation of somatic cancer variants"
abstract: >-
  VeriVar classifies somatic variants on ClinGen/CGC/VICC oncogenicity and the
  AMP/ASCO/CAP clinical tier under a faithfulness contract: the model may cite only
  identifiers it retrieved and must abstain when no variant-specific evidence exists.
  The repository includes the pipeline, a deterministic SOP-strict rule arm, the
  evaluation suite with leakage controls, every committed result file, and the
  manuscript. Research and education use only; not for clinical use.
type: software
authors:
